{"v":4,"catch":"擊敗敵人的坦克軍團，並將總部堅守到底！","desc":"「VS. BATTLE CITY\" 是 NAMCO (Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.) 於 1985 年推出的一款射擊遊戲。\n控制一輛坦克，面對敵人，同時捍衛自己的總部！\n勝利的關鍵在於打破牆壁、創造自己的路線、引導敵人到您有優勢的地方作戰，以及策略性地利用地形。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-09-12","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/83f50995cac4d497bfa42231e5375c8842145ce95d8a201ac35872baff672d0a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/43a3d7926ec8937b8f44eebc4591fecf893f40fe89d5901e61cc44f53c10edac.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/de6f0d20fcb5f1158748449b9d01587720baef881e22b30ed13916a70f2741cb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5267d8b5da1a828cdd32ff37e7efd64c5dcaf5f01e7682ac17f47b57c2bf502f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a713af1f4b9179da7dc1009ddbdaf9fa0653ffc4f886943fa4ed2cb835aada22.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0e8e6080d8383a7982368459989578ea34f8922202fde9581c2b04d2ba6add18.jpg"],"titleId":"010038201fb9c000","dlc":[]}